  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kharkiv HRG Core Support - Kharkiv HRG Pre Core Support</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till KHRG</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2010, Sida through the Embassy launched a programme of core        support to selected Ukrainian NGOs. NGO Kharkiv HRPG, one of the      oldest and most active human rights organisations in Ukraine, applied to become a candidate. In 2011 the SDA undertook a system-based audit of Kharkiv HRPG. It found it a worthy candidate and recommended that  Sida consider precore support to prepare for the core support.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&#xc5;r 2010 lanserade Sida genom ambassaden ett program f&#xf6;r               institutionellt st&#xf6;d till utvalda ukrainska enskilda organisationer.  Organisationen Kharkiv HRPG, en av de &#xe4;ldsta och mest aktiva          organisationer f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter i Ukraina, ans&#xf6;kte om        institutionellt st&#xf6;d. &#xc5;r 2011 genomf&#xf6;rde SDA en systemrevision av     NGO. Revisionen fann NGO en kandidat v&#xe4;rd st&#xf6;d.</narrative>
  </description>
